Value domain_id (\d+)
Value peer_status (.+?)
Value peer_keepalive_status (.+?)
Value configuration_consistency (.+?)
Value per_vlan_consistency (.+?)
Value type2_consistency (.+?)
Value role (.+?)
Value peer_gateway (.+?)
Value dual_active_excluded_vlans (.+?)
Value graceful_consistency_check (.+?)
Value auto_recovery_status (.+?)
Value delay_restore_status (.+?)

Start
  ^vPC\s+domain\s+id\s*:\s*${domain_id}\s*$$
  ^Peer\s+status\s*:\s*${peer_status}\s*$$
  ^vPC\s+keep\-alive\s+status\s*:\s*${peer_keepalive_status}\s*$$
  ^Configuration\s+consistency\s+status\s*:\s*${configuration_consistency}\s*$$
  ^Per\-vlan\s+consistency\s+status\s*:\s*${per_vlan_consistency}\s*$$
  ^Type\-2\s+consistency\s+status\s*:\s*${type2_consistency}\s*$$
  ^vPC\s+role\s*:\s*${role}\s*$$
  ^Peer\s+Gateway\s*:\s*${peer_gateway}\s*$$
  ^Dual\-active\s+excluded\s+VLANs\s*:\s*${dual_active_excluded_vlans}\s*$$
  ^Graceful\s+Consistency\s+Check\s*:\s*${graceful_consistency_check}\s*$$
  ^Auto\-recovery\s+status\s*:\s*${auto_recovery_status}\s*$$
  ^Delay\-restore\s+status\s*:\s*${delay_restore_status}\s*$$
  ^vPC Peer-link status -> Record End
